<title>JAPAN: Oyo buys Geometrics of U.S.</title>
<headline>Oyo buys Geometrics of U.S.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Geological research firm Oyo Corp said on Monday that it had acquired Geometrics Corp, a California-based manufacturer of research instruments.</p>
<p>Oyo said it paid $6.5 million from its own funds to purchase all of Geometrics shares. The purchase was conducted last Friday through Oyo's U.S. unit, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Oyo said it aims to expand its product lines and acquire new technologies through the purchase.</p>
